            ans: "$P(s_1|s_8)\\approx Q\\left(\\dfrac{\\sin(\\pi/8)}{\\sigma}\\right)=\\dfrac12\\,\\mathrm{erfc}\\!\\left(\\dfrac{\\sin(\\pi/8)}{\\sqrt2\\sigma}\\right)$"
